# The test site on each push to Website-site (Udi, 2026-11-20 20:26 UTC, "yes" to the Optimiser's proposal: the sweep runs after each push to Website-site, not once an hour).  Each minute it runs peoplesweb-next.service, which builds /next only if the branch has moved.  Installed and enabled by deploy/sweep.sh.
[Unit]
Description=peoplesweb.org/next on each push to Website-site

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* *:*:30
AccuracySec=5s

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
